    16	# Jev call — jev-prewave (recreation)
    17	
    18	_Per-call definition from jev-call-template.md. Designed 2026-11-14. The judgment: a scoring wave is the lane's expensive instrument — this call prices whether a build has EARNED its wave before the wave spends._
    19	
    20	## 1. What it judges
    21	- Deliverable: an attempt's build record (parameter table · construction route · own-checks results) BEFORE the Codex wave fires.
    22	- Call point: recreation INSTRUCTION §4, between the builder's own checks (§5.2) and the wave (§5.3). The verdict is advisory: applied, a HOLD returns the build to the builder with named defects and the wave does not fire on that item; set aside, the miss is recorded in Condense. An unfired call makes the cycle INCOMPLETE.
    23	
    24	## 2. Instruction (the model's charge)
    25	Judge whether this build record shows a recreation ready to be scored, or one whose defects are already visible in its own paperwork. Price: (1) PARAMETERIZATION — is the piece genuinely CONFIG-driven (fields named, ranges sane), or hard-coded with a config costume? (2) PURITY PRE-CHECK — does the construction route describe generation from parameters, with no tracing/embedding step hiding in the prose? (3) OWN-CHECKS COMPLETENESS — are the mechanical guards' results recorded (purity grep, swap test, syntax), or asserted? **Census-checkpoint mapping (Amendment A11, landed 2026-11-17, Cycle 028 Condense): every Observe census checkpoint for the item must map to an executable own-check assertion whose evaluation instant is CONFIG-derived; the build-record identifies checkpoint · assertion · CONFIG expression · evaluated result. ASSERTED-CHECKS is returned if any checkpoint lacks this mapping, any evaluation instant uses hardcoded defaults, or execution evidence is absent; a CONFIG timing swap must be shown to move the corresponding assertion's evaluation instant.** (4) TECHNIQUE FIDELITY PLAN — does the record state which packet mechanics the build implements and which it deliberately defers (a deferral named is lawful; a mechanic silently absent is not)? Score 0–1 per dimension, classify defects. You judge paperwork only: a build can pass you and still fail its wave — your job is that no wave is spent on a build its own record already condemns.
    26	
