    34	- Verdict classes: **FIRE-WAVE · HOLD**.
    35	- Dimensions (0–1): parameterization · purity pre-check · own-checks completeness · fidelity-plan honesty.
    36	- Rejection taxonomy (one primary): HARDCODED-CONFIG · TRACING-STEP · ASSERTED-CHECKS (results claimed, not recorded) · SILENT-DEFERRAL.
    37	- Accepted profile travels: cited in scores.md's pre-wave line; a wave fired over a HOLD is a deviation (WAVE-OVER-HOLD).
