   241	## 2. CONFIG key → application-site resolution (value-flow checked)
   242	| Key | Application site (value flows into) |
   243	|---|---|
   244	| windowStartS | record/label binding (segment trim documentation); not read by the animation logic — see note below |
   245	| headHandleS | comparison contract documentation; comparison.html carries its own HEAD_HANDLE_S — see note below |
   246	| timingScale | derive(): every card/word onset + finalHold scaling |
   247	| finalHoldMs | derive(): totalMs = lastFlip + finalHoldMs × timingScale |
   248	| epsilonMs | assertion instants in the verification harness (build-record) |
   249	| bg | stage background via CSS #000 fallback + contrast computations consume CONFIG bg |
   250	| unspoken{color,opacity,weight,scale} | render(): span style for unspoken words (all four fields applied) |
   251	| spoken{color,opacity,weight,scale} | render(): span style for spoken words (all four fields applied) |
   252	| contrastFloor | harness contrast assertions (own-checks) |
