   792	     3	Stage 360 px wide (16:9 → stage height 202.5 px). Stage box bound by amendment A10: `stageBox` 88% × 62% → box 316.8 × 125.55 px. Measurement model: per-glyph advance widths (Helvetica/Arial-class metrics, fractions of em) summed over each card's actual CONFIG words + the CSS word margin (0.18 em × 2 per word); greedy word wrap inside the box; the build's own `fitCard` shrink loop (maxSizePx 64 → minSizePx 20, step 2) applies the same contract in-browser. Ink height = cap-height-class ink ≈ 0.72 × font size. PIXEL-UNVERIFIED seat (no browser binary): geometry is measured from glyph metrics, not from a rendered frame — printed limitation, carried to scores.md.
   793	     4	
