   796	     7	| Card c1 "This system brings in varying" (5 spans) | stage box 316.8 × 125.55 | 40 px | 543 px | 2 | 28.8 px | 100.0 px ≤ 125.55 ✓ | 25.55 px vertical |
   797	     8	| Card c2 "types sizes, weights and animation," (5 spans) | stage box 316.8 × 125.55 | 32 px | 525 px | 2 | 23.0 px | 80.0 px ≤ 125.55 ✓ | 45.55 px vertical |
   798	     9	| Card c3 "so you can feel when my voice gets louder or softer" (11 spans) | stage box 316.8 × 125.55 | 32 px | 767 px | 3 | 23.0 px | 120.0 px ≤ 125.55 ✓ | 5.55 px vertical |
   799	    10	| HUD readout (non-subject, chrome) | stage bottom-left | 12 px monospace | — | 1 | ~8.6 px | n/a | n/a (not subject text) |
   800	    11	
   801	    12	Legibility floor (~11 px ink at 360 px stage): all subject rows 23.0–28.8 px — above floor ✓.
