   811	     7	Numeric literals outside CONFIG: CSS chrome sizes (8px/6px paddings, 12px HUD font, 14–16px button font, 50%/100% layout identities, 16/9 aspect identity), the word margin `0.18em` in the `.w` CSS rule, the fit loop step `2`, and the comparison-free constants `9/16` in fitCard's stage-height derivation. Classifications:
   812	     8	- `0.18em` word margin — geometry of the subject line BUT identical for every word/state and already reflected in the fit measurement; it does not shape state, timing, or content. Classified structural-fixed — CARRIED as a noted borderline (a future re-attempt may promote it to CONFIG as `wordMarginEm`); not a HIT under this leg's class (it promises no CONFIG control it fails to exert, and no lens can price it against the subject's state behavior).
