   975	study-jobs/recreation/runs/2026-11-18-cycle-034-wave-31/item-T196-observe-plan.md:89:**DOM word spans + one rAF clock + one stage slot.** ALL cards' spans are **prebuilt** at load (hidden); the stage slot shows exactly one card per half-open interval with **atomic handoff** (at a boundary instant: incoming card complete + visible, outgoing spans zero visible — asserted). State is a pure function of the timestamp — `state(word, t) = spoken iff word.onsetMs < t` (tie rule explicit) — so playback, seek, and restart derive identical states from the same t (cure 2). Entry states are computed from onsets, never stored. Stage box size is reserved before first paint (T03 readability cure: no layout shift). Rejected alternatives: typing/textContent append (T03's construction — IS the reveal T196 negates) · per-word CSS keyframes (timing in CSS, not CONFIG — A9.6 failure) · canvas + runtime text sampling (A1.2 precedent — lawful for formation techniques; here no formation exists, only state, so it adds a purity-priced surface for zero mechanic) · `<video>`/`<img>` of specimen (refusal class §6.1).
